Package: amd-halo-led-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: AMD Halo Box RGB LED driver, backported from Linux 7.3 (DKMS)
 The amd_halo_led WMI driver from Linux 7.3 (drivers/platform/x86/amd),
 unmodified, built out of tree for kernels that have the buffer-based WMI
 API but not the driver itself (7.0 to 7.2, e.g. Ubuntu 26.04's 7.0).
 .
 It exposes the light bar of the AMD Ryzen AI Halo box as
 /sys/class/leds/amd_halo:multicolor:status (multi_intensity = "R G B",
 each 0-100, and brightness 0-100).
 .
 Kernels from 7.3 on ship the driver; DKMS does not build this module for
 them and the package can then be removed.
